# Copy to docker/.env (gitignored). Both paths are resolved by the Docker daemon,
# which under docker-outside-of-docker runs on the HOST — so these must be paths
# as the host sees them, not container paths.
GRIMOIRE_LIBRARY=/Users/you/Development/grimoire-cli/docker/library
GRIMOIRE_DATA=/Users/you/Development/grimoire-cli/docker/data

# docker/seed.sh writes fixtures itself, from wherever it runs -- under
# docker-outside-of-docker that's the devcontainer, not the host. It needs the
# CONTAINER-side path to the same directory GRIMOIRE_LIBRARY names above, so the
# two vars point at one directory from two vantage points. Defaults to
# docker/library (relative to the repo root); only set this if seed.sh runs
# somewhere that path doesn't resolve to the bind-mounted directory.
# GRIMOIRE_LIBRARY_LOCAL=docker/library

# Same host-path requirement as GRIMOIRE_LIBRARY/GRIMOIRE_DATA above: the
# add-on index is served by a separate nginx container, so this bind mount is
# also resolved by the Docker daemon on the HOST. Defaults to ./addon-index
# (relative to docker-compose.yml).
# GRIMOIRE_ADDON_INDEX=/Users/you/Development/grimoire-cli/docker/addon-index
